<title>RUSSIA: Russian Jan unemployment rises to 9.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian Jan unemployment rises to 9.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Russia rose to 6.9 million or 9.5 percent of the workforce at the end of January from 6.8 million in December, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 JAN 97     DEC 96     JAN 96</p>
<p>    number unemployed (mln)	6.89	 6.79	 6.45</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	9.5	  9.3	  8.4</p>
<p>    officially registered (mln)  2.58	 2.51	 2.42</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for total unemployed are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
